    "description": "CIC Holdings delivers over 24% net profit growth in FY26 amid sectoral resilience",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/CIC-Holdings-delivers-over-24-net-profit-growth-in-FY26-amid-sectoral-resilience/34-792790",
    "lang": "en",
