    "chunk_size_bytes": 1402,
    "chunk_text": "Home Lands\u2019 flagship Pentara project completes piling work\n\nConstruction of Pentara Residencies Thummulla Handiya, Home Lands Group\u2019s iconic flagship development in the Colombo city, is well on track driven by Home Lands\u2019 unwavering commitment to delivering projects on time.\n\nD P Jayasinghe Piling Company Ltd., and Sanken Construction\u2019s San Piling Ltd., were chosen by Home Lands to carry out piling work of this mega Colombo city-based development in conformity with the highest standards. High quality piling work of this award-winning project is now complete. With piling work completed, construction of this mega project is on plan and well underway.\n\nHome Lands Group of Companies Chairman Nalin Herath said: \u201cWe are pleased to announce that construction progress of Pentara Residencies is well on track, with 100% of the piling work completed on time. We remain committed to delivering this landmark development on schedule, setting new benchmarks for luxury living in Colombo.\u201d\n\nNestled in the heart of Colombo and set to soar 40 levels high, Pentara Residencies \u2013 Thummulla Handiya will effectively redefine the Colombo skyline. Thummulla Handiya is among the most sought-after locations in Colombo, bordering Colombo 3, 4, 5 and the elite Colombo 7. With leading schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and essential services all within easy reach, it offers unmatched convenience."
  },
